## Java 코드

```java
public static void f(int a[], int t, int l) {  
    if (t >= l)  
        return;  
    System.out.print(a[t] + " ");
    f(a, t + 1, l);  
    System.out.print(a[t] + " ");
}
public static void main(String[] args) {
    int[] a = new int[]{1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7, 8, 9, 0};
    int n;
    n = 10;
    f(a, 0, n);
}
